{'symbol': 'CAG', 'date': '2022-04-12 16:10:00', 'title': 'CONAGRA BRANDS ANNOUNCES BOARD OF DIRECTORS CHANGE', 'text': 'CHICAGO , APRIL 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CONAGRA BRANDS, INC. (NYSE: CAG) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE DEPARTURE OF INDEPENDENT DIRECTOR SCOTT OSTFELD FROM ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS. MR. OSTFELD, A PARTNER OF JANA PARTNERS LLC AND MEMBER OF THE BOARD SINCE FEBRUARY 2019, HAS STEPPED DOWN TO ASSUME A BOARD SEAT AT ANOTHER COMPANY IN THE PACKAGED FOOD INDUSTRY.'}